#: scenario4:scenario4_D8C730E6_D220_4BD2_B4DB_B03613FE9E14
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7fa4d745744a8c894ce0c65034e6a6c4207e8badb1a0a83fec0b3f274019e901
#. default-sha256: 86a0746f51f0b80d74cd92170151eff22051d6b73031efc59808c4b346a94730
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D8C730E6_D220_4BD2_B4DB_B03613FE9E14"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫And that marked the true beginning of their quiet days together in "
"the dark mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫캄캄한 저택에서 보내는 ⟪k:23⟫평온한 생활. ⟪k:24⟫그건 ⟪k:25⟫비로소 진"
"정한 시작을 맞이했습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F085551F_4068_4559_A67F_4A1C65501FE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2af9d6fe98fe3d380ab692c5a01a643a67ed7647521e7f8108c897f18789236
#. default-sha256: 36bbee814c1eb74965b2a552bab43fa9f0a5dfc833256aaee1b9b4642297d3aa
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F085551F_4068_4559_A67F_4A1C65501FE9"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They acknowledged and accepted each other’s presence, no longer isolating themselves, but "
"actively, regularly conversing."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫서로의 존재를 인정하여 ⟪k:1⟫이별하지 않고, ⟪k:2⟫마주한 채 대화를 나누는 시간."

#: scenario4:scenario4_934438FF_AB82_4D4C_96E2_98AD5581A9ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f3a2e6ae9a22bdc4f58b7002d8ba28e5da38b6395c32e3a1a5cd633313c2c690
#. default-sha256: 26daf20526f4aa459cccd65387ad1fee3bc5a883faf3caaac0ea6768766377a6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_934438FF_AB82_4D4C_96E2_98AD5581A9ED"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As mundane as it might seem, it was something they had been unable to attain until then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 ⟪k:1⟫당연하면서도⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫둘이 여지껏 얻지 못 한 나날……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F1DB41FD_7525_49AD_9B08_BE017AF4B59C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d86f301beeb92e6494ce1a6bfbe3eba268f85da5113c5ea1ebf8a9844f66b587
#. default-sha256: d994f94deb3d8dabd3f6290c1fc967c49fbd37542298e4f981562641021c168c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F1DB41FD_7525_49AD_9B08_BE017AF4B59C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nevertheless, they were still somewhat fumbling around in the dark with one another, drawing "
"closer and pushing away again."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫둘의 마음의 거리는 ⟪k:1⟫가까워지나 싶으면 멀어지는 등, ⟪k:2⟫어색했습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_8FEAAD6E_DEF7_4BF9_983B_A2DB5D1404F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13f9abd96a9153f61f4bb1924ee5b625fa86e9867bac09dc7c6697cdaffca293
#. default-sha256: 70a178f23f7a484582327101cfb38f0fbbec35d639cfdfe5ddc2463dfafe1df7
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8FEAAD6E_DEF7_4BF9_983B_A2DB5D1404F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel, in his own ungraceful way, was beginning to open himself up to the things she said,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그래도 ⟪k:1⟫미셸은 어색하게하나마 소녀의 말에 귀를 기울이기 시작했으며――"

#: scenario4:scenario4_26C4B32C_F056_4E69_A1BF_1C2B822B551A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cbc3b32fc4bafcfe12a635cb89b778e8eef753a0e85f7b4f38827e382bc98f31
#. default-sha256: 6b7803ac2d42a51d5d3e4b6e5f8a6b8192b601323cd88d99cb4430498160b481
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_26C4B32C_F056_4E69_A1BF_1C2B822B551A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and the White-Haired Girl was beginning to smile with greater frequency."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫백발 소녀도 ⟪k:1⟫미소가 많아졌습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_0E8068CF_1E52_4198_89D8_E1C794B849A0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eba3bff45215525834e7047bed1d73d44652fd388343d86fd13dda647429a9d5
#. default-sha256: 1e0a78cc9f256e61e0615d8257f8ab0d233ffa36f6ae5020ea1e126739db40a5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0E8068CF_1E52_4198_89D8_E1C794B849A0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They had taken to dining together, and her wish of learning to read was being granted."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫식사도 함께 하기 시작했고, ⟪k:1⟫전에 소녀가 말한 「문자를 가르쳐 달라」는 부탁도 이루어졌습니"
"다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_54D32434_00B1_47B9_BD97_C3623016EE94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5712a285e92f59fde0a7e60ad7e206ec42ec41a6a1cd4610b07237dbb3a2ff17
#. default-sha256: 44db45e11a1776ddb0925134cc0ffba72e9732d65621f3c0b4b696b320802db1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_54D32434_00B1_47B9_BD97_C3623016EE94"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He taught her in the feeble light of a candle placed upon the table, the two sitting across "
"from one another."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫한 책상에 마주 앉고, ⟪k:1⟫못 미더운 촛불 밑에서―― 소녀는 문자 읽는 법을 깨우쳐 갔습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FD793E1F_F6F9_441C_B905_B179018226C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6dae27a9833ba5486e67192a737dd080e4d2e58da87dceb3598bc243d85ae927
#. default-sha256: ef04974ccc4a827759d907abbb42af88f397bd47ac3fec6cd4a1ac3a409bfe54
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FD793E1F_F6F9_441C_B905_B179018226C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though Michel seemed to be well educated, he had not been instructed in the art of teaching, "
"so he found the process quite grueling."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫미셸은 학식이 있는 청년이었으나, ⟪k:1⟫남에게 뭘 가르치는 데에 능하진 않았는지, ⟪k:2⟫그건 제"
"법 난항을 겪었습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_397AB7EF_2D6D_4E70_AFC4_AA1C02627DB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 329f5f1cea6cd7f30c3215c85a955b5440a6a047244061ca7cebcc2a43745a30
#. default-sha256: 5bb22500ae52fb97a1c4088f73f452d061cd2847096dd8cdc12ce92595591fa8
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_397AB7EF_2D6D_4E70_AFC4_AA1C02627DB5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But to the White-Haired Girl, the longer it took the better;⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫her primary objective "
"was, after all, to spend time with him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫시간이 오래 걸릴수록 좋은 법입니다. ⟪k:2⟫왜냐하면…… 소녀의 가장 큰 목적은 ⟪k:3⟫함"
"께 지내는 것⟪k:4⟫이었으니까요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_169BCDD3_EA39_4040_91FA_8DEA88A1E072
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f8920fd60db4ef1186a306ae4cd2e4728dd7ef2653cd921847dc48e2c743cbfc
#. default-sha256: e11b1283109bae7e9c69b1944438b4eb16503ebbcfa19cd353cfb6c0d6437b52
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_169BCDD3_EA39_4040_91FA_8DEA88A1E072"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The days passed,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그러면서 ⟪k:1⟫둘의 일상이 흐르다 보니――"

#: scenario4:scenario4_864C6DC9_F3F0_4202_9C3D_51E1AA4616BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 773541d64757a7159a19baccee493cdb16cc7e3ab7e9fa6c046f7794a99edf47
#. default-sha256: a3f265d9087f148841805c2cfd2f817d45fc147648f35692f705fe2778534675
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_864C6DC9_F3F0_4202_9C3D_51E1AA4616BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and eventually, she reached the point where her comprehension was adequate enough without "
"assistance. ⟪k:1⟫Her next request, then, was for them to read through a book together."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫소녀는 혼자서도 불편하지 않을 만큼은 ⟪k:1⟫읽는 법을 익혔습니다. ⟪k:2⟫그런데도 이어서 ⟪k:3⟫"
"「함께 책을 읽어 달라」고 부탁했지요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_BA67D6B6_3E00_47E2_B154_E49365D0681C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d682e3c4b4ddd4c2302396ce19c975823224d03ff4c39957c7dffeef294cdf08
#. default-sha256: 339efc214d6a1e9264c3756063b5229eb8736dce379c87564d20e36482fcd704
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BA67D6B6_3E00_47E2_B154_E49365D0681C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Have you read every book in the library?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫여기 있는 책은 ⟪k:5⟫다 읽으신 건가요?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_7DAB50FB_8948_45A9_923F_F1699154B38F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40faccc05559216772d84a7720a53a6c8755ae6b48ffad5e9dd0ec68db9fbb44
#. default-sha256: 5f3cb0cd718c3963d765c15ac3c14b455bfb93bd397ffcf8f682ab4e3a96e5e1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7DAB50FB_8948_45A9_923F_F1699154B38F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫No... ⟪k:5⟫I stopped looking at them after a while."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫아뇨……, ⟪k:5⟫중간부터 읽기를 그만뒀습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_07BD7C42_2024_42BF_A7AC_3D6680ADB294
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18610713c9e139d08be0ad0f24ae9371c7d05951cf71a2ab08f15a0f60e787a5
#. default-sha256: 22efe53b38165dedd1d34fe4b76d18ec68afecb7eeab430b0f01cdf8d7e8d63b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_07BD7C42_2024_42BF_A7AC_3D6680ADB294"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Most everything I’m sent is dull, uninformative dreck.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The diary of a lord... "
"⟪k:4⟫Foolish make-believe tales..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫오는 책은 죄다 ⟪k:2⟫지식에 보탬도 안 되는 시답잖은 것뿐입니다. ⟪k:3⟫영주가 남긴 일기, "
"⟪k:4⟫하잘것없는 공상 이야기 등……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_8D35450D_B142_480E_A9F5_804E8D21EB2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cdf126b19c0c9d682b39aebf8abcc698ecc543250a2d36d6b53405f926637673
#. default-sha256: b55b0a381c897e0877610850b5bd3907ac7cc34e3b3af9d9c40ea0cf82dae78c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8D35450D_B142_480E_A9F5_804E8D21EB2F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You’re not fond of fiction, I take it?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이야기를 ⟪k:1⟫별로 안 좋아시는군요……?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_AE1BC5CF_BE0C_42C0_8420_E000E3D78D5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bcbeb3181fc4d1e242a3f91919d4a5d13d7738b2027a5e0b7de676f25c3a29b1
#. default-sha256: 96e9dbc156010a332f4a1b7e9623738be1ec6495f9649882a3d7fa5b6a2c0ccb
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AE1BC5CF_BE0C_42C0_8420_E000E3D78D5F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What value is there in the lies and fantasies of another?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫거짓으로 점철된 남의 공상에 ⟪k:1⟫무슨 가치가 있겠습니까."

#: scenario4:scenario4_5D9DCB1D_9C9E_4905_8D6B_3C0E3265D28F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 87ce7f5a25417c431297213526e442963721299b795af7980a644a4050e940fe
#. default-sha256: b4b849487ceb660e61f27d13bd4cb34fe22eeee7926739caeda5d13b3c0dac45
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5D9DCB1D_9C9E_4905_8D6B_3C0E3265D28F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Stories... ⟪k:1⟫can be invigorating.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Tales of adventure can take you places you "
"could never go."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그래도…… ⟪k:1⟫이야기는 ⟪k:2⟫종종 마음의 갈증을 축여 주지 않나요? ⟪k:3⟫모험담은 ⟪k:4⟫직접 가 "
"보지 못 한 땅을 상상하게 해 주고요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_79A4C059_3588_4A67_84DB_1DAE20CFEF5B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95d869c65c5255634fef4809843bf1dd8844f1549c1bb03055f7d2ac909985fc
#. default-sha256: 447871eeac58853fba8830b49263fdeff338e2de68a8de28befb9b56419e6cb0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_79A4C059_3588_4A67_84DB_1DAE20CFEF5B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Legends of heroes, folklore, stories of otherworldly phenomena.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫They can be "
"terrifying, and they can be exhilarating."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫영웅 전설, ⟪k:1⟫신의 전승, ⟪k:2⟫현실에 없는 현상을 엮은 이야기 등은―― 때로는 무서우며, ⟪k:3⟫"
"때로는 가슴을 뛰게 해 줘요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_E64A5DAE_C4BE_41D7_96DE_D6DB8B7054E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b0188e0d08d46f2cdb113a87ee233f1d3b7ac66a50c211a3efba5d3c1e761a35
#. default-sha256: adf1534513d0a3ef0d644fa173de54df4145e2a2d3f1a69cd1bbb6bf7743bd9c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E64A5DAE_C4BE_41D7_96DE_D6DB8B7054E0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They may not be real, but they give you a little glimpse into the author’s heart—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫"
"let you feel like you’re seeing the same thing they saw."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그게 비록 ⟪k:1⟫거짓이라도, ⟪k:2⟫작가의 마음에 접하는 것 같고, ⟪k:3⟫그 광경을 저도 같이 보는 "
"것 같은…… 마음이 들게 해요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_0558A8F4_B267_478E_88CC_3059E51F9061
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c42db7d03b81e9d146a2433823761613b845f816f3349b0e44030e54f519327b
#. default-sha256: f6cec4f0574cde2669589054c1855d1d053e89ead4a8ca6b3e312af4189000d5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_0558A8F4_B267_478E_88CC_3059E51F9061"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...You are a very empathetic girl.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Fiction inspires nothing of the sort in me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫………당신은 ⟪k:1⟫감수성이 풍부해서 그런 겁니다. ⟪k:2⟫저는 ⟪k:3⟫그렇게 느끼질 못 하겠습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_8F0A27F9_A8FB_4812_A0BB_03F19731376B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c99ac1ea320a426a5da6efed645ff4dd8e4fd6f80e1010d29981e9aaced80d7c
#. default-sha256: 672d550d9689d121f4dc1e7bae3d1c745e5fd420f030aa22508ad3efeedf0166
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_8F0A27F9_A8FB_4812_A0BB_03F19731376B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……하지만……."

#: scenario4:scenario4_1EB8D266_8768_4E89_94AE_0D39579A75FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 966ffdc5974952435f869e1c5ca260c2cc2abb24e8fe0990c38b5548b660be1c
#. default-sha256: 8dae5bed4461f594ae1bd7a6b145e313fe2e5900975476b2235fcf3255bf410a
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1EB8D266_8768_4E89_94AE_0D39579A75FE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_F934972B_8D87_4A6F_9D42_88AA60C16AD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
