msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6E93AF0E_3F0B_43E5_8203_FF7AFE8D2AB0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The villagers had gone mad, but their wish for freedom from the drought ⟪k:1⟫had⟪k:2⟫ been "
"granted."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫마을 사람들은 ⟪k:1⟫저주 때문에 미쳤지만, ⟪k:2⟫원래 바라던 ⟪k:3⟫하늘의 은총은 이루어지지 않았"
"는가?"

