msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_503B1D10_7A96_4482_B0B4_12473BE67B6C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What I don’t understand, though...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫is why the witch is said to grant people’s "
"wishes."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……그런데 ⟪k:1⟫이 이야기는 신기하네요. ⟪k:2⟫마녀는 왜 ⟪k:3⟫소원을 이루어 주는 걸까요?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_09B4A17E_5E4B_4F1F_93E8_A5EF858E0083
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5cc9f2fca35bb5cc01e49e08e75101f9166ebe62041ccb97abdd0b9ff639d15
