msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That is to say, she had reason enough to hold a grudge,⟪k:1⟫but not to give people things "
"they asked for."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫마녀 입장에선 ⟪k:1⟫원망할 이유는 있을지언정 ⟪k:2⟫소원을 이루어 줄 필요는 없을 거 아니에요."

#: scenario4:scenario4_8E992D15_AD18_4C4C_8775_C9BFF52C1243
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed11ef130f58c8029a39e14db92de5d6bc4713ba9a18866fd0989181f99ce65a
