msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫All we have to go on is a few pages.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫There’s no saying what might have been changed "
"or added over time,⟪k:3⟫and it’s almost certain the entire legend isn’t written here."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫고작 몇 페이지짜리 전승 아닙니까. ⟪k:1⟫이야기가 어디서 어떻게 와전되거나 ⟪k:2⟫지어질진…… 우리"
"가 알 수 없습니다. ⟪k:3⟫이야기되지 않은 부분도 많을 겁니다."

