#: scenario4:scenario4_BD34731D_3871_4E8B_9CC9_AB154614A3F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6e1251f9314ca05e2147fa9e53f3f280ac5b0c3b9ae912b51d6e3076e11e0683
