msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mansion has an observation tower.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Or, I suppose, what ⟪k:3⟫used to be⟪k:4⟫ an "
"observation tower.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫At any rate, it is quite a tall structure."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫이 저택에는 ⟪k:1⟫감시탑이 있습니다. ⟪k:2⟫감시탑이었던 곳…… 그렇게 불러야겠군요. ⟪k:3⟫그런데 "
"⟪k:4⟫그 탑이 꽤 높습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_232507DC_CB0E_4DFE_B4F0_5F49E6A1E001
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9718bcd7618d95b026fce2d63707568147ed437641cf38b1ab6d42e6fc3251a6
