msgstr "⟪k:0⟫네. ⟪k:1⟫데려가…… 주시겠어요?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_71CF4F07_DA57_42DD_A8DA_1E4989D87721
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc50c3f3c91525697ff39a10a05fb9348c24674bc65e034c93a0de28ae278fdb
