msgid "⟪k:0⟫revealing a small room with no windows or doors in sight."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫한없이 작으며 ⟪k:1⟫폐쇄적인 방이 있었습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_2450C494_16D3_472C_ABAC_4FB3A8B26FAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 23acc22477530d5ea051821305e04f50ad4fc34d543fde9435d1a2019621f490
