msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This is... ⟪k:3⟫the top of the tower?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫여기가…… ⟪k:3⟫최상층⟪k:4⟫인가요?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_469ACD43_F360_4D40_9337_C7C39BAAA1C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a1f588a7f2144abe4c0e441f17b78845c6374baa48f0676d0c24011589662002
