msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_469ACD43_F360_4D40_9337_C7C39BAAA1C0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Despite it being called an “observation” tower,⟪k:1⟫you could hardly observe anything from "
"there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“감시”탑이란 이름이 붙었건만, ⟪k:1⟫이래선 아무것도 안 보이지 않겠는지요. ⟪k:2⟫그 이름이 ⟪k:3⟫"
"참으로 무색한 곳이었습니다."

#: scenario4:scenario4_91F67F05_9FD7_4CCA_BE9A_2FB93429678E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c3a2426552d91acd99fca07fd0d82b23687c6b30303a5d840c270a37f8af373e
